  "qualification": "These legacy controls execute App directly in one pytest process, not new-test parent/child wrappers. Media exact and Paste pass; paced native keys intentionally reproduce queryt/2rows. Notes original titleNoMatches is INVALID for reopen; titleprep passes all original outcomes; held row-message reproduces exact post-autosave reopen failure. Sandboxed launch failure never launched pytest. Historical CI interleavings are inferred from sufficient matching native witnesses, not directly captured. No permanent source fix or post-fix GREEN is implied; raw .log files remain private."
